          <commentary>시간비를 1로 본 값이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>100</choice_text>
          <commentary>Lr = 100, Tr = √100 = 10이므로 10 × 10 = 100분으로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
